                      <p class="feature-text" data-i18n="home.featureCard4Body">Hundreds of templates are available to get you started with whatever’s on your plate.</p>
                      <a href="#" class="feature-btn feature-btn" data-i18n="home.featureCard4Cta">Start with templates</a>
                  </div>
                  <div class="feature-features">
                      <img class="feature-img" src="../../static/assets/feature5.webp" alt="">
                      <h3 class="feature-heading" data-i18n="home.featureCard5Title">Connect with your other tool</h3>
                      <p class="feature-text" data-i18n="home.featureCard5Body">Link Todoist with your calendar, voice assistant, and 30+ other tools.</p>
                      <a href="#" class="feature-btn feature-btn" data-i18n="home.featureCard5Cta">Install integrations</a>
